  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Required number of numbers&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>5</mn></msup><mtext>&#8203;</mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>.</p><p>{Since, between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>99</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1000</mn></math>, the numbers are of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> digits, but those numbers should be omitted in which <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math> comes at hundreds place}.</p>",
